rRDP 2.0.0 (Release date: 2026-10-01)
==============

Changes:
* rRDP is no longer on Bioconductor, but can now directly be installed from 
  R-universe.
* The dependency on rRDPData was removed and the data for the default clasifiers 
  are automcatically downloaded.


rRDP 1.37.3 (Release date: 2024-03-26)
==============

Changes:

* Updated to the lated RDP Classifier version 2.14 released in August 2023 
  which contains the bacterial and archaeal taxonomy training set No. 19.